name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q10_2025'

question 'A rideshare app decides whether to show a "Car on the way!" message or "No drivers available" based on who\'s nearby. Which of these best describes how the app makes that choice?'

right 'It uses an if/else statement to check if any drivers are within range.'
wrong 'It randomly decides which message to show every few seconds.'
wrong 'It asks the user to refresh until a driver appears.'
wrong 'It shows both messages at once so the user can choose which one to believe.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 5
